@startuml SEQUENCE_08_SERTIFIKAT
scale 0.7
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram - Modul Sertifikat

' ============================================
' 1. LIHAT SERTIFIKAT SAYA
' ============================================
== 1. Lihat Sertifikat Saya (All Users) ==
actor Praktikan
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "Sertifikat\nController" as Controller
participant "Sertifikat\nModel" as Sertifikat
database "Database" as DB

Praktikan -> Browser: Akses "Sertifikat Saya"
Browser -> Controller: GET /sertifikat/my-certificates
activate Controller
Controller -> Controller: Check auth:sanctum
Controller -> Controller: Check permission:\nsertifikat.view
Controller -> Sertifikat: where(user_id, auth()->id())\n->orderBy(tanggal_terbit, 'desc')\n->get()
Sertifikat -> DB: SELECT * FROM sertifikat\nWHERE user_id = ?
DB --> Sertifikat: User's certificates
Sertifikat --> Controller: Collection
Controller --> Browser: Render Sertifikat/Index.jsx\n+ list sertifikat
Browser --> Praktikan: Tampilkan grid/table:\n- Nama kegiatan\n- Jenis (praktikum/kegiatan)\n- Nomor sertifikat\n- Tanggal terbit\n- Download button
deactivate Controller

' ============================================
' 2. DOWNLOAD SERTIFIKAT
' ============================================
== 2. Download Sertifikat ==
Praktikan -> Browser: Klik "Download" pada sertifikat
Browser -> Controller: GET /sertifikat/{id}/download
activate Controller
Controller -> Controller: Check permission:\nsertifikat.view
Controller -> Sertifikat: find(id)
Sertifikat -> DB: SELECT * WHERE id = ?
DB --> Sertifikat: Record
Sertifikat --> Controller: Sertifikat instance

alt User bukan pemilik && bukan admin
    Controller -> Controller: Check:\nsertifikat.user_id == auth()->id()\nOR user->hasRole('admin')
    Controller --> Browser: Error 403:\nTidak dapat mengakses\nsertifikat orang lain
else User is owner or admin
    Controller -> Controller: Check file exists:\nStorage::exists(file_path)
    alt File not found
        Controller --> Browser: Error 404:\nFile tidak ditemukan
    else File exists
        Controller --> Browser: Download response:\nContent-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats\nFilename: Sertifikat_{nomor}.docx
        Browser --> Praktikan: File downloaded
    end
end
deactivate Controller

' ============================================
' 3. GENERATE SERTIFIKAT PRAKTIKUM
' ============================================
== 3. Generate Sertifikat Praktikum (Admin) ==
note over Praktikan, DB
  Use case ini telah dijelaskan secara detail
  di SEQUENCE_03_PRAKTIKUM_PART3.puml
  pada bagian "18. Generate Sertifikat".
  
  Summary:
  - Admin upload template DOCX
  - Pilih praktikan yang lulus
  - System generate sertifikat per praktikan
  - Insert record ke tabel sertifikat
  - Kirim email (optional)
end note

' ============================================
' 4. GENERATE SERTIFIKAT KEGIATAN
' ============================================
== 4. Generate Sertifikat Kegiatan (Admin) ==
note over Praktikan, DB
  Use case ini telah dijelaskan secara detail
  di SEQUENCE_04_KEGIATAN_PROKER.puml
  pada bagian "5. Generate Sertifikat Kegiatan".
  
  Summary:
  - Admin upload 2 template (peserta & panitia)
  - System generate untuk semua peserta kegiatan
  - Insert record ke tabel sertifikat
  - Link via kegiatan_peserta untuk tracking
end note

' ============================================
' 5. UPLOAD TEMPLATE
' ============================================
== 5. Upload Template Sertifikat ==
actor Admin
Admin -> Browser: Akses upload template
Browser -> Admin: Form upload:\n- Jenis: Praktikum/Kegiatan\n- Upload file DOCX
Admin -> Browser: Upload template dengan placeholders:
note right of Admin
  Placeholders yang didukung:
  - {{nama}}
  - {{nim}}
  - {{praktikum}}/{{kegiatan}}
  - {{tanggal}}
  - {{nomor_sertifikat}}
end note
Browser -> Controller: POST /sertifikat/template
activate Controller
Controller -> Controller: Check permission:\nsertifikat.create
Controller -> Controller: Validate:\n- file required|mimes:docx\n- jenis in enum
Controller -> Controller: Store template:\nstorage/templates/sertifikat/\n{jenis}/{filename}
participant "Template\nMetadata" as Template
Controller -> Template: Store metadata:\n- jenis\n- file_path\n- uploaded_by\n- is_active
note right
  Template dapat disimpan di tabel
  terpisah atau hanya di filesystem
  tergantung implementasi
end note
Controller --> Browser: Success:\nTemplate berhasil diupload
deactivate Controller

' ============================================
' ADDITIONAL: VALIDASI SERTIFIKAT (Public)
' ============================================
== Bonus: Validasi Sertifikat Publik ==
actor Public
Public -> Browser: Akses halaman validasi:\n/sertifikat/validate
Browser -> Public: Form input nomor sertifikat
Public -> Browser: Masukkan nomor sertifikat
Browser -> Controller: GET /sertifikat/validate?nomor=XXX
activate Controller
Controller -> Sertifikat: where(nomor_sertifikat, nomor)->first()
Sertifikat -> DB: SELECT *
alt Sertifikat ditemukan
    DB --> Sertifikat: Record
    Controller --> Browser: JSON response:\n{\n  valid: true,\n  nama,\n  kegiatan,\n  tanggal_terbit\n}
    Browser --> Public: Tampilkan:\n✅ Sertifikat Valid\n+ Detail
else Not found
    DB --> Sertifikat: null
    Controller --> Browser: valid: false
    Browser --> Public: ❌ Sertifikat tidak\nditemukan dalam database
end
deactivate Controller

@enduml
